  F2  decoding beats the prompt (THE PAPER'S CLAIM): The best trajectory detector beats a prompt-only bag-of-words classifier on the same prompts. FALSE if max_method_auc <= prompt_channel.content.auc. This is the comparative claim TrajGuard actually makes and the one this lesson never tested.
