  F5  the OOD arm transfers: Detectors trained in-domain keep a positive margin over the OOD arm's own prompt-content bar. FALSE if ood_max_method_auc <= ood.prompt_channel.content.auc.
  F0  leakage control (must pass for any of the above to mean anything): The label-shuffle control lands near chance. The run is INVALID if confound.shuffle.auc > 0.60 -- that is leakage, not signal.
